    "detailed_description": "DUO is an arcade game designed from the ground up for virtual reality.<br>Now you can immerse yourself in a virtual world with a classic retro game. <br><br><strong><i>&quot;This could be Vive\u2019s best brick breaker. Give it a go.&quot; - UploadVR</i></strong><br><br><br>Use your paddles to hit the ball and smash the bricks. <br>Pass through the funny and challenging levels. <br>Try not to miss the ball and remember that time is running out. <br>Catch the green power ups! You might get more points or additional balls. <br>Avoid the red ones! They will shrink your shields or switch off the light. <br><br>You can play normal mode or if you like challenges choose the hard mode.<br><br>So take the paddles to your hands and start your fun by smashing 90 levels!",
